                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 64.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Hall</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-03-27"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 27,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Hall is informed that the United States vessels on the north and south coasts
                    have been ordered to protect the American interests in Central America.</p>
            </div>
